## Why This Is Asked

This question probes on-device ML, multi-language NLP, privacy, and business trade-offs in a realistic, consumer-facing feature.

## Key Concepts

- On-device inference and model sizes
- Multilingual NLP and drift handling
- Update strategies and telemetry design
- Privacy/compliance and data localization
- Cost-to-benefit modeling and go/no-go criteria

